DolphyX
=======

This repository is a modified version of Dolphy-App:
  https://github.com/unvoiddd/Dolphy-App
  Copyright (C) the Dolphy-App contributors
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0

Modifications:
  - Rebuilt and extended by aegisSoft / mrSpy (MrSpy00), 2026.
  - New monochrome design system based on the original app's design language.
  - Added BLE chat, Flipper .ir import, RTSP camera discovery, DLNA cast,
    IPP Print-Job, QR sharing, and Turkish localisation.
  - Removed attack/abuse modules (BLE spam/jammer, TWS hijack, BadUSB,
    phishing, unauthorized brute force, unrestricted code execution).
  - Hardened storage, exported components, permissions, and local networking.
  - Added unit tests and documentation.

